---
// Testimonial Section — UI UX Pro Max: Social Proof-Focused pattern
// "Testimonials with photos, star ratings, success stories"
---

<section class="bg-cream px-5 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px]">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-center font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-navy md:text-3xl">
      ลูกค้าพูดถึงเรา
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-10 text-center text-sm text-warm-gray">
      ความประทับใจจากผู้ที่ได้รับคำปรึกษาเรื่อง Unit Link
    </p>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-border bg-white p-6 shadow-card transition hover:shadow-card-hover">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-1 text-gold">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 1l2.39 6.09H19l-5.3 4.09 2 6.41L10 13.5l-5.7 4.09 2-6.41L1 7.09h6.61z"/></svg>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 1l2.39 6.09H19l-5.3 4.09 2 6.41L10 13.5l-5.7 4.09 2-6.41L1 7.09h6.61z"/></svg>
